        </div>
        <div class="subj">
          <div class="row1">
            <span class="name">外语（二外英语）<span class="st">单词阶段 · 已学约 12% 词库</span></span>
            <span class="pct">15%</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bar"><div style="width:15%; background:#9333ea;"></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="subj">
          <div class="row1">
            <span class="name">政治<span class="st">托管班推进中</span></span>
            <span class="pct">26%</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bar"><div style="width:26%; background:#ea580c;"></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="subj">
          <div class="row1">
            <span class="name">综合写作 & 一对一<span class="st">方法论笔记已定稿</span></span>
